SUMMARY:Lunch Box Lecture
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Historic Preservation Month by learning about the historical development of Fayetteville Street\, the preservation of the Briggs building\, and how the Briggs Building has anchored Raleigh’s Main Street throughout past and present.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/lunch-box-lecture/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
