SUMMARY:Plant Swap! At the City of Raleigh Museum
DESCRIPTION:Calling all plant lovers! Join us for an exciting plant swap event. \nBring your favorite house and garden plants or homegrown vegetables to trade with fellow plant enthusiasts. We ask that you bring only healthy\, pest-free plants to ensure everyone’s enjoyment. This event is free and open to the public!
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/plant-swap-at-the-city-of-raleigh-museum/
LOCATION:City of Raleigh Museum\, 220 Fayetteville Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Copy-of-Plant-Swap-Flyer-Instagram-Post-45.png
